Name your stack of daggers/arrows/whatever and setup an
autopickup exception to pickup anything with that label. It
makes managing missile weapons much easier.

For example, in my defaults.nh I have the line:
autopickup_exception="<*storm"

Any missiles that I want to keep I name "daggerstorm"
or arrowstorm and I'll always pick them up.

